WEBVTT

00:03:27.870 --> 00:03:30.122
I know more and I know better.

00:03:30.164 --> 00:03:34.794
So I built my house on high steel posts,

00:03:34.835 --> 00:03:37.922
iron roofing and all modern materials.

00:03:38.798 --> 00:03:41.175
When my house was finished,
they came and told me,

00:03:41.217 --> 00:03:42.385
"You are wrong."

00:03:42.426 --> 00:03:43.678
(Laughter)

00:03:43.719 --> 00:03:45.805
And funny enough, they were right.

00:03:45.805 --> 00:03:47.556
(Laughter)

00:03:48.099 --> 00:03:51.686
So in 2021, we had unusually strong winds,

00:03:51.686 --> 00:03:53.646
and my house got blown over,

00:03:53.688 --> 00:03:54.855
so it tilted sideways.

00:03:54.855 --> 00:03:56.607
And I lost some roof.

00:03:57.358 --> 00:04:01.320
Most of the houses in the village
only experienced mild effects